// Opt-in indexed arena scalar lists. Stable two-pair handle tags 2046
// (int) and 2047 (bool); private backing tag 2048. Handle contains length
// and backing offset/readiness. Lazy allocation, capacity 4..4096 doubling.
// RAX=handle, R8=mode (0 new int,1 new bool,2 len,3 get,4 set,5 push,6 pop),
// R9=index, R10=payload. RDI/RSI retain bitmap metadata; indexed arena
// R12/R13/R14. RAX=result, RDX=status; no writes on rejection. Growth
// preflights live pairs, allocates new backing via indexed allocator,
// copies values and publishes handle metadata; no rejecting step after
// allocation. Retired backing is retained (no GC); pop clears live slot.
// Trusted exclusive arena and private handles; no concurrency, canonical
// ABI, source opcode integration, reference elements or dynamic maps.
// Appended exact indexed allocator and guard; do not mix with old leaves.
import "ccam_aggregate_native_indexed_arena.cap";

